      "content": "i mean it was only for like 2 minutes and it's already 100% back to normal now. it feels way too extreme to go to the er for something that's already gone away... i dont want to sit in a waiting room for 6 hours if it was just some weird eye strain or something. u think it's actually worth the trip since i feel fine right now?",
